- on success: setResult, download automatically? Spec: "Download automatically or provide a clear Download button." I'll show a Download button + auto-download. Auto-download may be blocked if not user-gesture-initiated? It's within a promise after a click — generally allowed (Chrome allows programmatic download without gesture). I'll auto-download and show the button too.
