So: script `scripts/generate-output.ts` (run with esbuild-register? simplest: build with esbuild to a temp mjs and run with node). Let's do:
`node_modules/.bin/esbuild scripts/generate-output.ts --bundle --platform=node --format=esm --outfile=/tmp/gen.mjs --external:...` bundling everything including pdf-lib and pdfjs. Then `node /tmp/gen.mjs` reads sample pack, produces output/<id>_Package.pdf.

